# 🛒 Role-Based Management App

Full-stack web app with Customer, Shopkeeper, and Admin panels.

## Features
- Customer: Buy products, view orders
- Shopkeeper: Manage products, inventory, suppliers
- Admin: Manage users, products, orders

## Tech Stack
- React (Vite)
- Node.js + Express
- MySQL

## Setup

### Backend
cd backend
npm install
node server.js

### Frontend

cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev

